# Language stats on GitHub (Linguist).
#
# The chart folders are Helm charts copied from upstream (Bitnami, Splunk Operator). Their
# templates made GitHub label the whole repository "Go Template", so they are marked vendored.
# The customised values.yaml in each chart root and the manifests in the repository root are
# the work here, so they stay in and count as YAML.
argo-cd/** linguist-vendored
fluent-bit/** linguist-vendored
ghost/** linguist-vendored
grafana/** linguist-vendored
prometheus/** linguist-vendored
splunk-enterprise/** linguist-vendored
splunk-operator/** linguist-vendored
/*/values.yaml -linguist-vendored
*.yaml linguist-detectable
